{"path":"pydantic.config.FieldInfo.deprecation_message","kind":"property","dispname":"deprecation_message","docUri":"https://docs.pydantic.dev/latest/api/pydantic/fields/#pydantic.fields.FieldInfo.deprecation_message","signature":null},{"path":"pydantic.config.AliasGenerator","kind":"class","dispname":"AliasGenerator","docUri":"https://docs.pydantic.dev/latest/api/pydantic/aliases/#pydantic.aliases.AliasGenerator","signature":"(alias: 'Callable[[str], str] | None' = None, validation_alias: 'Callable[[str], str | AliasPath | AliasChoices] | None' = None, serialization_alias: 'Callable[[str], str] | None' = None) -> None","doc":"!!! abstract \"Usage Documentation\"\n    [Using an `AliasGenerator`](../concepts/alias.md#using-an-aliasgenerator)\n\nA data class used by `alias_generator` as a convenience to create various aliases.\n\nAttributes:\n    alias: A callable that takes a field name and returns an alias for it.\n    validation_alias: A callable that takes a field name and returns a validation alias for it.\n    serialization_alias: A callable that takes a field name and returns a serialization alias for it.","doc_summary":"!!! abstract \"Usage Documentation\" [Using an `AliasGenerator`](../concepts/alias.md#using-an-aliasgenerator)"},{"path":"pydantic.config.ComputedFieldInfo","kind":"class","dispname":"ComputedFieldInfo","docUri":"https://docs.pydantic.dev/latest/api/pydantic/fields/#pydantic.fields.ComputedFieldInfo","signature":null},{"path":"pydantic.config.ConfigDict","kind":"class","dispname":"ConfigDict","docUri":"https://docs.pydantic.dev/latest/api/pydantic/config/#pydantic.config.ConfigDict","signature":"(...)","doc":"A TypedDict for configuring Pydantic behaviour.","doc_summary":"A TypedDict for configuring Pydantic behaviour."},{"path":"pydantic.config.FieldInfo","kind":"class","dispname":"FieldInfo","docUri":"https://docs.pydantic.dev/latest/api/pydantic/fields/#pydantic.fields.FieldInfo","signature":null},{"path":"pydantic.config.PydanticUserError",